# Owner-approved public build-time disclosures; no credentials.
VITE_OWNER_CONTACT_URL=mailto:attila.bordan@snhu.edu
VITE_BACKUP_RETENTION_NOTICE="Operator-held database backups are encrypted and access-restricted and retained for no more than 30 days after snapshot creation, including copies under the operator's control. Mission expiry does not immediately erase an earlier backup. Backups are used for recovery, not public sharing. Provider-managed logs and recovery copies follow separate provider retention policies. Contact the owner about data or access; there is no self-service server deletion tool."
